@"
# Crucible System Execution Rules

- Always generate minimal surgical diffs targeting only the failing statement.
- Never rewrite whole files or alter formatting of passing logic.
- Ignore build artifacts, .git, venv, and node_modules.
- Never hardcode a target repository path in this file or in any mode/rule file - the target is always passed as a parameter (--target flag) to scripts/run_heal.py.
- Output clean summaries adhering strictly to:
  [TRIAGE]: File, Line, and Error Root Cause
  [PATCH]: Explanation of the surgical change
  [VERIFICATION]: Command to execute for validation and its result
"@ | Out-File -Encoding utf8 .bobrules